# Tuition and carry-forwards. Read in October 2026 on the CRA's federal and provincial Schedules 11
# (5000-S11 and the 428 schedules S11) for 2024 and 2025, Schedule 9, and Revenu Quebec's Schedule T.
#   donationLimit: the share of net income up to which donations (this year's and those carried forward) are claimed
#   fed.tuitionTransfer, prov.tuitionTransfer: the most of this year's tuition a student can transfer to a spouse, parent or grandparent
#   prov.tuition: whether this year's fees give the provincial or territorial credit (unused amounts carried forward always count)
#   qc.tuition: Quebec's credit rate on tuition fees (no dollar maximum on the transfer to a parent)
rule tax.donationLimit RATE
rule tax.fed.tuitionTransfer AMOUNT
rule tax.prov.tuition YES_NO province
rule tax.prov.tuitionTransfer AMOUNT province
rule tax.qc.tuition RATE

