# Quebec's contributions on the return. Read in October 2026 on Revenu Quebec's Schedules F and K
# (TP-1.D.F-V and TP-1.D.K-V) for 2024 and 2025, the line 447 help, and Finances Quebec's 2026
# parameters. Schedule K for 2026 is not published: its maximum comes from the RAMQ premiums (as in 2025:
# half of each plan year's maximum), its exemptions and rates stay those of 2025 until it is.
#   qc.fss: exclusion threshold; second threshold; rate; the most below the second threshold; maximum
#   qc.drugPremium: the year's maximum premium; family income exempt for a person alone; a single parent with
#     one child; with two or more; a couple; a couple with one child; with two or more; where the higher rate
#     starts (income above the exemption); rates below and above it for a person alone; for a couple
rule tax.qc.fss LIST
rule tax.qc.drugPremium LIST

